WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:10.350 --> 00:00:11.530
All right.

00:00:11.530 --> 00:00:14.193
Let's do this one last time.

00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:21.040
My name is Conan Denise O'Brien.

00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:22.860
When I was 15 years old I was bitten

00:00:22.860 --> 00:00:25.880
by a radioactive party
clown at my quinceañera.

00:00:25.880 --> 00:00:27.240
You probably know the rest.

00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:30.985
With no talent, comes no responsibility.

00:00:30.985 --> 00:00:34.060
Dad, how does that help me?

00:00:34.060 --> 00:00:35.610
It doesn't.

00:00:35.610 --> 00:00:37.000
Too late old man.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:40.950
That feral clown gave me powers
beyond my wildest dreams,

00:00:40.950 --> 00:00:42.957
which made me very popular in high school.

00:00:42.957 --> 00:00:44.220
(locker banging sound)

00:00:44.220 --> 00:00:45.680
And popular with the ladies.

00:00:45.680 --> 00:00:47.770
(locker banging sound)

00:00:47.770 --> 00:00:50.421
I even met my first love.

00:00:50.421 --> 00:00:52.838
(soft music)

00:00:53.821 --> 00:00:56.770
(rock music)

00:00:56.770 --> 00:01:00.160
Now I could've used my
powers to fight crime,

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:01.740
battle evil

00:01:01.740 --> 00:01:03.550
and rescue innocent people.

00:01:03.550 --> 00:01:04.880
Asshole.

00:01:04.880 --> 00:01:07.050
But instead I opted for cheap laughs

00:01:07.050 --> 00:01:08.167
and light celebrity chat.

00:01:08.167 --> 00:01:10.189
You're afraid of heights?

00:01:10.189 --> 00:01:12.330
Yes, it's true, it's true.

00:01:12.330 --> 00:01:13.381
Fascinating!

00:01:13.381 --> 00:01:14.214
Mm-hmm.

00:01:14.214 --> 00:01:15.047
(crowd laughing)

00:01:15.047 --> 00:01:16.632
I even met my best friend, Andy.

00:01:16.632 --> 00:01:19.600
I'm so sick of your voice!

00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:21.960
Yup, the Conan empire's alive and well.

00:01:21.960 --> 00:01:25.530
I have a hit podcast, a cereal,
a line of toys, a sex column

00:01:25.530 --> 00:01:27.290
in South West airlines magazine,

00:01:27.290 --> 00:01:29.210
an erectile dysfunction medication

00:01:29.210 --> 00:01:30.520
and was recently named the face

00:01:30.520 --> 00:01:32.980
of skin cancer awareness in Malaysia.

00:01:32.980 --> 00:01:35.510
And now, I've returned
to San Diego Comic-Con®

00:01:35.510 --> 00:01:37.440
for the fifth time.

00:01:37.440 --> 00:01:39.970
I'm like the cool high
school student who graduates

00:01:39.970 --> 00:01:42.270
and comes back to hang out the next year.

00:01:42.270 --> 00:01:44.299
Everybody loves that guy.

00:01:44.299 --> 00:01:47.140
Hey, are you Amy Adams?

00:01:47.140 --> 00:01:48.250
No.

00:01:48.250 --> 00:01:50.157
I am Comic-Con®!

00:01:50.157 --> 00:01:53.323
And Comic-Con® is me!

00:01:53.323 --> 00:01:54.310
(police siren plays in the background)

00:01:54.310 --> 00:01:56.614
Step down from the mailbox, Ms.Adams.

00:01:56.614 --> 00:01:57.447
(car horn screeches)

00:01:57.447 --> 00:02:00.447
(upbeat jazz music)

